Subject: [PATCH] fixup! avalanche: vote over SHA256-identified eCash mempool
 batches

Expose the already implemented NODE_MERKLIX_EPOCH service bit to Python peers so batch-specific fixtures can opt into the existing capability filter. Constant1<<28 exactly matches protocol.h. No protocol negotiation or production behavior added.

Tier: ECASH
---
 test/functional/test_framework/messages.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/test/functional/test_framework/messages.py b/test/functional/test_framework/messages.py
index f5c8f34ad4..6f334481ea 100644
--- a/test/functional/test_framework/messages.py
+++ b/test/functional/test_framework/messages.py
@@ -57,6 +57,7 @@ NODE_COMPACT_FILTERS = 1 << 6
 NODE_NETWORK_LIMITED = 1 << 10
 NODE_AVALANCHE = 1 << 24
 NODE_UTXO_SHARD = 1 << 25
+NODE_MERKLIX_EPOCH = 1 << 28
 
 MSG_UNDEFINED = 0
 MSG_TX = 1
